+      "summary": "Mac menu bar app plus browser extension for parents: hard-block popular distraction apps and sites during school hours or any chosen windows, while the blocked state presents modular downloadable school lessons (math first). Pivot from a personal forced time-boxing blocker (schedule, blocklist, accountability password) into asymmetric parent control, school allowlists, and lesson-filled lock time. Enforcement honesty: Tier A MVP is local app + extension (bypassable); Screen Time / FamilyControls is later roadmap, not day-one claims.",
+      "tags": [
+        "mac",
