+      "jumpstartPrompt": "Build a remote MCP server simulating a full commerce flow with fake payments for agent demos and testing.\n\n## Core Tools\n\n1. **list_products** - Browse product catalog:\n   - Output: products with id, name, price, image URL, inStock boolean\n   - 20-30 demo products across categories (electronics, books, apparel)\n\n2. **add_to_cart** - Add product to session cart:\n   - Input: productId, quantity\n   - Returns updated cart summary\n\n3. **get_cart** - View current cart contents\n\n4. **create_checkout_session** - Start checkout:\n   - Input: mode (always 'simulate' for this product)\n   - Output: session ID, total, simulated payment URL\n   - Display SIMULATED PAYMENT badge prominently\n\n5. **confirm_simulated_payment** - Complete fake payment:\n   - Input: sessionId, simulatedCardLast4 (any 4 digits)\n   - Output: order confirmation with fake order ID\n   - Never charges real money\n\n6. **get_order** - Retrieve simulated order details\n\n## OAuth and Safety\n\n- OAuth scopes: `products:read`, `cart:write`, `orders:simulate`\n- Mode enforcement: reject any attempt to use mode=live\n- Clear visual indicators: all responses include `isSimulation: true`\n- Documentation warning: THIS IS A DEMO SERVER, NO REAL PAYMENTS\n\n## Data\n\n- Static product catalog (JSON or D1)\n- Cart stored in Durable Object per session\n- Simulated orders stored for 24 hours\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- Agent can browse products and add to cart\n- Checkout flow clearly marked as simulated\n- Impossible to trigger real payment\n- Light-themed product images and descriptions\n- Complete purchase flow demo script included\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- Cloudflare Workers MCP server\n- Durable Objects for cart sessions\n- Static product catalog\n- OAuth 2.0 with clear scope definitions\n\nDeliver: MCP server URL, product catalog JSON, end-to-end demo script, safety documentation."
