+      "jumpstartPrompt": "Build a remote MCP server for boutique fashion inventory management and restock workflow.\n\n## Core Tools\n\n1. **get_low_stock** - Items below reorder point:\n   - Output: products with current quantity, reorder threshold, supplier info, last order date\n   - Filterable by category (dresses, accessories, shoes)\n\n2. **get_sell_through_rate** - Sales velocity analysis:\n   - Input: optional date range, category\n   - Output: items with units sold, stock remaining, days of inventory left, sell-through percentage\n\n3. **get_supplier_catalog** - Available items from suppliers:\n   - Input: supplier ID\n   - Output: products, wholesale prices, MOQ, lead times\n\n4. **draft_purchase_order** - Create PO draft:\n   - Input: items array (productId, quantity), supplier ID\n   - Output: PO summary with total cost, estimated delivery\n   - Saves to owner review queue\n\n5. **create_purchase_order** - Submit PO (requires confirmation):\n   - Input: draft PO ID, owner confirmation token\n   - Output: PO number, email sent to supplier\n   - Never auto-submits without owner approval\n\n6. **get_pending_orders** - Track incoming inventory:\n   - Output: POs with expected delivery dates and items\n\n## Intelligence\n\n- Restock suggestions based on sell-through and seasonality\n- Alert when fast movers are low\n- MOQ optimization (bundle slow movers with best sellers to meet minimums)\n- Supplier comparison for same item across vendors\n\n## OAuth and Permissions\n\n- Scopes: `inventory:read`, `orders:draft`, `orders:submit`\n- Owner approval required for create_purchase_order\n- Standing rules: agent can check low stock daily and draft PO, but owner must confirm\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- Agent identifies low stock items accurately\n- Sell-through analysis informs restock quantities\n- PO drafts require explicit owner confirmation before submission\n- Clear cost and lead time visibility\n- Light-themed inventory dashboard\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- Cloudflare Workers MCP server\n- D1 for inventory and PO data\n- Durable Object for real-time stock tracking\n- Email integration for supplier POs\n\nDeliver: MCP server, sample inventory dataset (100+ SKUs), sell-through analysis demo, PO confirmation workflow guide."
