red\n- Customer context helps personalize responses\n- Light-themed ticket interface\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- Cloudflare Workers MCP server\n- D1 for tickets and customers\n- Integration hooks for real support platform (Zendesk, Intercom)\n- Sentiment analysis via Workers AI\n\nDeliver: MCP server, 100+ demo tickets across issue types, support conversation demo script, refund sandbox safety documentation."
