er\n- D1 for lessons, submissions, progress\n- Workers AI for exercise grading\n- OAuth with parent owner role\n- Email notifications for unlock requests\n\n## Content\n\n- 50+ free lessons (math, reading, science)\n- 3 paid content packs (10 lessons each)\n- Demo parent/student accounts\n\nDeliver: MCP server, sample lessons, parent gate demo script showing unlock request/approval flow, grading rubric examples."
