players\n- Compelling narrative and puzzle design\n- Light-themed room descriptions\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- Cloudflare Workers MCP server\n- Durable Object for shared game state\n- Puzzle graph stored in D1\n- WebSocket for real-time state sync (optional)\n\nDeliver: MCP server, complete 5-room game script, cooperative play demo (two agent instances), puzzle solution guide."
