+      "jumpstartPrompt": "Build a remote MCP server for a trading card pack opener simulation with safe monetization separation.\n\n## Core Tools\n\n1. **get_balance** - Current simulated credits:\n   - Output: credit balance, currency name (\"gems\" or \"coins\")\n\n2. **open_pack** - Open one card pack:\n   - Input: pack type (basic/premium/legendary)\n   - Costs credits\n   - Output: 5-10 cards with rarity, stats, artwork URL\n   - Server-side rarity roll (weighted random)\n\n3. **get_collection** - Player's card collection:\n   - Output: owned cards, duplicates count, completion percentage\n\n4. **get_pack_odds** - Transparency display:\n   - Output: exact drop rates per rarity tier\n   - Legally required in many jurisdictions\n\n5. **trade_duplicates** - Convert dupes to credits:\n   - Input: card IDs to trade in\n   - Output: credits earned\n\n6. **daily_login** - Free credits:\n   - Output: daily credit bonus, streak count\n\n7. **purchase_credits** - Buy credits (simulation only):\n   - Input: package tier\n   - Output: simulated purchase confirmation\n   - NEVER charges real money\n   - Separate tool for real IAP would require different OAuth scope\n\n## Monetization Safety\n\n- This MCP: simulated credits only, no real money\n- Real purchase tool: separate MCP with `payments:live` scope (not included in this product)\n- Clear labeling: \"SIMULATION MODE\" in all purchase flows\n- Demo safe for public use without payment risk\n\n## Game Design\n\n- Card rarities: common (60%), uncommon (25%), rare (10%), epic (4%), legendary (1%)\n- 200+ unique cards across rarities\n- Pack prices: basic (100 credits), premium (250), legendary (500)\n- Daily login: 50 credits\n- Duplicate trade-in: 10-500 credits based on rarity\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- Agent can open packs and collect cards\n- Rarity rolls feel exciting (legendary pulls are rare)\n- Drop rates transparently displayed\n- No real money charges possible\n- Collection tracking and completion goals\n- Light