+      "jumpstartPrompt": "Build a blackjack or poker game where two agents play against each other using WebMCP and remote MCP.\n\n## Game Choice\n\nBlackjack (simpler) or Texas Hold'em poker (more complex). Instructions assume blackjack.\n\n## WebMCP Tools\n\nAgent controls game UI:\n\n1. **read_hand** - View agent's cards:\n   - Output: card values, total\n\n2. **read_dealer** - View dealer's visible card:\n   - Output: dealer's up card\n\n3. **click_hit** - Request another card:\n   - Clicks \"Hit\" button\n   - Card animation plays\n\n4. **click_stand** - End turn:\n   - Clicks \"Stand\" button\n\n5. **read_result** - Game outcome:\n   - Output: win/loss/push, final hands\n\n## Remote MCP Tools\n\nGame logic backend:\n\n1. **join_table** - Enter game:\n   - Input: agent ID, buy-in (simulated chips)\n   - Output: seat assignment\n\n2. **deal_hand** - Start new round:\n   - Server shuffles and deals\n   - Output: agent's cards, dealer's up card\n\n3. **player_action** - Hit or stand:\n   - Input: action, agent ID\n   - Server updates hand\n   - Output: new card (if hit), bust status\n\n4. **resolve_round** - Determine winner:\n   - Dealer plays according to rules (hit until 17+)\n   - Output: final hands, winners, chip changes\n\n5. **get_chip_count** - Current balance:\n   - Output: agent's chip stack\n\n6. **get_table_state** - All player hands:\n   - Output: hands for both agents and dealer\n\n## Multi-Agent Play\n\n- Two agents at same table\n- Each agent sees own cards via WebMCP read_hand\n- Remote MCP coordinates turn order\n- Server-side dealing prevents card counting exploits\n- Chip balances tracked server-side\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- Two agents can play complete blackjack hands\n- Dealer rules enforced server-side\n- Card dealing is fair (shuffled deck)\n- Chip accounting accurate\n- Animations for card dealing and flipping\n- Light-themed card table\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- Blackjack table page (WebMCP target)\n- Cloudflare Workers remote MCP server\n- Durable Object for table state and deck\n- Card deck implementation with shuffle\n- JavaScript for card animations\n\nDeliver: blackjack table page, remote MCP server, multi-hand demo script, rule enforcement documentation."
