+      "jumpstartPrompt": "Build a cooperative maze game where one agent creates a maze and another agent solves it.\n\n## Concept\n\nTwo-phase game:\n\n**Phase 1 (Agent A)**: Create and publish maze\n**Phase 2 (Agent B)**: Navigate and solve maze\n\nAgent B cannot see Agent A's creation process; only the published maze.\n\n## Phase 1: Maze Creation (Agent A)\n\n**WebMCP Tools**:\n- **place_wall** - Click to add wall segment\n- **place_start** - Set starting position\n- **place_goal** - Set goal position\n- **add_trap** - Optional trap obstacles\n\n**Remote MCP Tools**:\n- **publish_maze** - Submit maze:\n  - Input: wall coordinates, start, goal, traps\n  - Server validates maze is solvable\n  - Output: maze ID for Agent B\n\n## Phase 2: Maze Solving (Agent B)\n\n**WebMCP Tools**:\n- **read_maze** - View maze layout\n- **move_up/down/left/right** - Navigate\n- **read_position** - Current coordinates\n\n**Remote MCP Tools**:\n- **get_maze** - Load published maze:\n  - Input: maze ID\n  - Output: maze layout (walls, start, goal)\n- **record_solution** - Submit completion time:\n  - Input: move count, elapsed seconds\n  - Leaderboard entry\n\n## Validation and Scoring\n\n- Server validates maze is solvable before publishing\n- Optimal solution calculated for comparison\n- Agent B scored on: completion time, move count, vs optimal\n- Leaderboard shows best solutions per maze\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- Agent A can design creative mazes\n- Maze validation prevents unsolvable puzzles\n- Agent B successfully navigates published maze\n- Scoring system compares to optimal solution\n- Light-themed maze grid with clear walls and paths\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- Maze editor page (WebMCP target for creation)\n- Maze player page (WebMCP target for solving)\n- Cloudflare Workers remote MCP server\n- D1 for maze storage\n- Pathfinding algorithm for validation (A* or BFS)\n\nDeliver: maze editor page, maze player page, remote MCP server, pathfinding validator, 10 demo mazes, creation and solving demo scripts."
