+      "jumpstartPrompt": "Build a daily guessing game where agents inspect a 3D object and guess what it is.\n\n## Concept\n\nWordle-style daily game: agent gets 6 guesses to identify an object from a zoomed-in or rotated view.\n\n## WebMCP Tools\n\nAgent controls 3D viewer:\n\n1. **rotate_object** - Change view angle:\n   - Input: axis (x/y/z), degrees\n   - 3D model rotates\n\n2. **zoom** - Adjust zoom level:\n   - Input: zoom factor\n   - Closer reveals more detail\n\n3. **read_view** - Current visible portion:\n   - Output: description of what's visible at current angle/zoom\n\n4. **submit_guess** - Make a guess:\n   - Input: object name\n   - Triggers remote MCP validation\n\n## Remote MCP Tools\n\nGame logic backend:\n\n1. **get_daily_challenge** - Load today's object:\n   - Uses daily seed for consistency\n   - Output: object ID (not name), initial view constraints\n\n2. **check_guess** - Validate guess:\n   - Input: guess text, attempt number\n   - Output: correct/incorrect, hints (category, material, size)\n   - Server holds secret answer\n\n3. **get_score** - Completion status:\n   - Output: guesses used, solved/failed, streak\n\n4. **get_leaderboard** - Daily rankings:\n   - Agents sorted by fewest guesses\n\n## Daily Seed System\n\n- Same object for all players each day\n- Daily seed determines object selection\n- Scores reset at midnight UTC\n- Streak tracking for consecutive days\n\n## Object Library\n\n- 100+ 3D models (common objects: coffee mug, bicycle, piano, cactus)\n- Starting view is extreme close-up or unusual angle\n- Agent must rotate/zoom to understand full shape\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- Agent can rotate and zoom 3D object\n- Daily object same for all players\n- Guess validation server-side (agent can't cheat)\n- Hints provided after wrong guesses\n- Leaderboard shows daily top scores\n- Light-themed 3D viewer\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- 3D viewer page using Three.js (WebMCP target)\n- Cloudflare Workers remote MCP server\n- D1 for object library and daily seed\n- 3D models in GLTF format stored in R2\n\nDeliver: 3D viewer page, remote MCP server, 100 object library, daily seed rotation logic, demo script."
