itchen UI with clear ingredient visuals\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- Pizza kitchen page (WebMCP target)\n- Cloudflare Workers remote MCP server\n- Durable Object for order queue and inventory\n- JavaScript for drag-and-drop and baking timer\n\nDeliver: kitchen page, remote MCP server, 50 demo orders, shift score dashboard, demo script."
