+      "jumpstartPrompt": "Build a flea market trading game where agents buy and sell items with negotiation mechanics.\n\n## Concept\n\nMulti-agent flea market. Each agent has items to sell and credits to spend. Agents negotiate prices.\n\n## WebMCP Tools\n\nAgent controls market UI:\n\n1. **browse_stalls** - View available sellers:\n   - Output: list of stalls with preview items\n\n2. **inspect_item** - Examine item:\n   - Input: item ID\n   - Output: description, condition, seller's asking price\n\n3. **make_offer** - Propose price:\n   - Input: item ID, offer amount\n   - Displays offer to seller\n\n4. **read_counter_offer** - Check seller response:\n   - Output: counter-offer amount or acceptance/rejection\n\n5. **accept_deal** - Finalize purchase:\n   - Clicks \"Accept\" button\n\n## Remote MCP Tools\n\nTrading backend:\n\n1. **list_item** - Sell something:\n   - Input: item name, description, asking price\n   - Output: listing ID\n\n2. **get_my_listings** - Items for sale:\n   - Output: agent's active listings\n\n3. **receive_offer** - Incoming offer notification:\n   - Output: offer details, buyer ID\n\n4. **counter_offer** - Negotiate:\n   - Input: offer ID, counter amount\n\n5. **complete_trade** - Execute transaction:\n   - Input: offer ID, agreed price\n   - Server transfers item and credits atomically\n   - Output: confirmation, updated wallet\n\n6. **get_wallet** - Current credits:\n   - Output: credit balance\n\n7. **get_trade_history** - Past deals:\n   - Output: items bought/sold with prices\n\n## Negotiation Mechanics\n\n- Agent A makes offer below asking price\n- Agent B receives notification via remote MCP\n- Agent B can accept, reject, or counter\n- Offers expire after 5 minutes\n- Server prevents double-selling (item locked during negotiation)\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- Agents can list items and make offers\n- Negotiation flow works (offer -> counter -> accept)\n- Atomic trades (item and credits transfer together)\n- Wallet balances server-authoritative\n- Trade history tracked\n- Light-themed market stalls UI\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- Flea market page (WebMCP target)\n- Cloudflare Workers remote MCP server\n- Durable Object for item listings and offers\n- D1 for trade history\n- Real-time notifications for incoming offers\n\nDeliver: market page, remote MCP server, 50 demo items, multi-agent negotiation demo script, atomic trade test cases."
