Document for conference booth staff:\n\n1. **Hardware**: large display (or two displays), tablet for QR code, stable internet\n2. **QR code printed cards**: hand to visitors\n3. **Demo script**: booth staff can walk through if visitor wants guided tour\n4. **Reset button**: clear game state between demos\n5. **Leaderboard displays**: show top agents for both games\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- Single QR code gets visitor to both games and MCP config\n- Starter prompts work copy-paste for major AI agents (Claude, GPT, etc.)\n- Tool-call ticker clearly shows WebMCP vs remote MCP\n- Polyfill enables non-Chrome agents to play\n- Booth staff can reset demos quickly\n- Light-themed, professional booth branding\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- Landing page (static HTML + QR code generation)\n- Both game pages from previous prompts\n- Tool-call ticker (JavaScript overlay)\n- Browser polyfill script\n- Booth admin panel for resets\n\nDeliver: complete booth package (landing page, 2 games, QR codes, starter prompts, ticker overlay, polyfill, booth staff guide), setup instructions, demo walkthrough video."
